Third-party data

The alignments, structure models and reports in this repository include sequence records and identifiers from public databases, including UniProt and UniRef, MGnify, NCBI (SRA and RefSeq), JGI IMG and BV-BRC, and models from AlphaFold DB. Structure models were predicted with AlphaFold2, ColabFold, Boltz-2 and ESMFold2-Fast. These third-party records remain subject to their sources' terms and are not relicensed by this repository's CC BY 4.0 LICENSE.
